<Layout title="Contact Resumv & report a content issue" description="Send feedback about Resumv, report a resume guide correction, or describe a problem with the browser-based resume editor."><article class="page-wrap article"><header class="page-heading"><h1>Help us make your next draft better.</h1><p>Questions, corrections, and product feedback are welcome.</p></header><h2>Feedback on GitHub</h2><p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/liusha-com/resumv/issues">GitHub Issues</a></p><p>For a content correction, include the page URL, the statement that needs attention, and a reliable source if you have one. For an editor problem, include your browser, device type, and the steps that led to the issue.</p><p>GitHub Issues are public. For security vulnerabilities, follow our <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/liusha-com/resumv/blob/main/SECURITY.md">private security reporting policy</a>.</p><h2>Keep your information private</h2><p>Do not send passwords or confidential applicant, patient, employee, or client data. Use fictional details when describing a resume-editing problem. Your locally saved documents are not available to us through the website.</p><div class="topic-links"><a href="/help/">Tool help</a><a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial policy</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></div></article></Layout>
